# GitHub language detection
#
# vmlinux.h is a kernel-generated header (3.3 MB) vendored solely so the eBPF
# program can be compiled without a full kernel source tree. Left unmarked it
# outweighs all hand-written Go by ~4x and GitHub classifies the repository as
# "C", hiding it from Go language filters and rankings.
internal/execsnoop/bpf/vmlinux.h linguist-vendored

# Emitted by bpf2go via `go generate ./internal/execsnoop/`.
internal/execsnoop/execsnoop_x86_bpfel.go linguist-generated
internal/execsnoop/execsnoop_x86_bpfel.o linguist-generated -diff

# Emitted by protoc-gen-go / protoc-gen-go-grpc from api/proto/enclave.proto.
api/gen/** linguist-generated
